// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Detective Bauer 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1926058998" "Detective Bauer"
// ProfessionString :
"P915817252" "Police Liason"
// DescriptionString :
"P3960899698" "Detective Bauer comes to the Paragon Police Department following a number of high profile cases working for several different agencies. Bauer throws himself into his work, and can get an amazing amount done in a single day."
// HelloString :
"P2819630067" "Do you have the time, {HeroName}?"
// HelloString :
"P3379955465" "There's not a lot of time, {HeroName}!"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2598204197" "I don't have time to deal with you {HeroName}. You should speak to Detective McDallas."
// FirstVisitString :
"P26816625" "Good to have you on the team, {HeroName}. Let me make sure you have the frequencies, and then we can get to work."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3094026059" "I'm sorry, {HeroName}, but things have gotten complicated. Maybe you should move on to somewhere they need you more."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P3045858513" "You have too much on you right now. Beleive me, I know all about having a busy day, and I think you need to finish some things before you start something else."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P476778135" "I need good people to do this job. I know you want to help, but you need to be at least security level 10 before you'll be able to help me."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P4242783924" "I'm glad I can count on you, {HeroName}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P852537093" "You've been a real help, {HeroName}."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P2699285044" "Look, I have problems that need handling, sure, but there are more important things. Things you need to do. You've done a lot, but you need to go on, and do more, elsewhere."
// LocationString :
"P3493519327" "Steel Canyon"
// IntroString :
"P3474423818" "Detective Bauer is one of the hero liasons in Steel Canyon, and I know he could use some help."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P961145843" "Choose Detective Bauer"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P1241826540" "Detective Bauer is often under a lot of stress, and I'm sure he could use your help."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P706259802" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>I hear a friend of mine </a> is looking to meet you."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P3428775255" "I hear some of my other  <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>friends</a> would like to meet you."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


