// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Detective Sluggitt 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P2914466648" "Detective Sluggitt"
// ProfessionString :
// DescriptionString :
"P696174426" "Detective Sluggitt is a tough cop who cares about the people he works with and the people he protects. He has a reputation around the department for fighting for the right thing, even when it's not the wisest thing to do."
// HelloString :
"P1179754480" "Time starts now, {HeroName}."
// HelloString :
"P2840620893" "Let's get to work."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2395314214" "{HeroName}? I thought you're supposed to be working with Detective Westbrush. Go talk him, see what he has to say."
// FirstVisitString :
"P2835982406" "Good to meet you, {HeroName}. There's a lot going on, but first let me make sure you have the right frequencies for the local police radio band. Now you can check that whenever you need to."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3759505771" "My investigations have wrapped up. In the meantime, I'm sure you're needed elsewhere. And thanks for the help, {HeroName}."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P912718977" "You've got a lot going on, {HeroName}, and I need people who are focused. Finish off some of you're other work, then come back."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P3888496995" "I need you to get tougher if you want to help me. Come back when you're around security level 10."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P654848806" "I've seen what you've done. Good work, {HeroName}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P2413109569" "You really stuck to that case, {HeroName}. I respect that."
// LocationString :
"P970836190" "Skyway City"
// IntroString :
"P2116097144" "Detective Sluggitt works in Skyway City. He's a dedicated cop, but he could use some help."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P3202473741" "Choose Detective Sluggitt"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P723862411" "Detective Sluggitt will do all he can to help you."
// IntroduceOneContact :
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
