// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Detective Westbrush 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1362936876" "Detective Westbrush"
// ProfessionString :
// DescriptionString :
"P2550450781" "Detective Westbrush has a bad reputation for use of excessive force, but no one can argue with his records. He gets the job done, even if a lot of people don't like his methods."
// HelloString :
"P2059343250" "Make my day, {HeroName}."
// HelloString :
"P458360294" "Do you feel lucky, {HeroName}? Well? Do you?"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P1384216907" "You got a problem, {HeroName}? Maybe you don't know, or maybe you just don't get it. You're supposed to be working with Detective Sluggitt, not me."
// FirstVisitString :
"P2710772880" "{HeroName}, huh? Can't say I'm impressed, but the city needs you people. Let me make sure you have the frequencies for the police band, and then we can get started. You do enough for us, we'll keep you in the know if something big goes down."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P2889262725" "We're done. You got better things to do than hang around here."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1655328867" "I think you've got too much going on already, {HeroName}. Get the rest done, then you can bother me again."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P541199700" "You don't have what it takes... Yet. Come back when you're security level 10."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P1684702036" "You've done... Pretty well, {HeroName}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P3348511882" "I can respect anyone who's put that much scum behind bars."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P1219116367" "Detective Westbrush is in Skyway City. He's a tough customer with a bad reputation."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P3169078193" "Choose Detective Westbrush"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P1566875788" "Detective Westbrush has a bad reputation, but he gets the job done."
// IntroduceOneContact :
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


