// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Detective_Cooper 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 28 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Detective Cooper 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1812159189" "Detective Cooper"
// ProfessionString :
// DescriptionString :
"P1732437781" "An investigative genious, Detective Cooper requested assignment to Croatoa to investigate the strange happenings around here. Cooper is regarded as a bit of an eccentric, with a love for black coffee and a habit of taking notes for his personal secretary. His immaculate record speaks for itself, however."
// HelloString :
"P1088208525" "Mighty fine coffee around here. And hot, too."
// HelloString :
"P2506504999" "{HeroName}, never drink coffee that has been anywhere near a fish. Trust me on that."
// HelloString :
"P2852052694" "Mighty fine coffee around here."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3807735099" "Of course I am familiar with your work, {HeroName}, but working with you has not fallen to me. Perhaps you should speak with Detective Truman?"
// FirstVisitString :
"P1134965279" "{HeroName}, coincidence and fate figure largely in our lives. Take this moment here. Is it fate or coincidence that brought you to Croatoa? Well, I suppose it may not matter, as long as you're here to help. These frequencies will make sure you can access the local police radio. There are many interesting things you can learn that way. And as I'm sure you're aware, if you get a good record with us, we'll let you know if something big is going to happen."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1728666548" "{HeroName}, what are you waiting around for? You've got places to go and people to see! Now, move on. There are many things that need your attention, and we can handle things here."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P60073652" "In the grand design, heroes were definitely drawn from a different set of blueprints. But that doesn't mean you can do anything. Never split your attention. If you're drinking coffee, drink that coffee and pay attention to that coffee. Similarly, if you have a number of missions to do, you should probably do them before you go looking for more."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P1887268310" "All life has a rythm to it, and this is not yet the right point for you to join the rythms of this place. Come back when you're around level 25 or so. Yes, that should be about right."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P292503269" "{HeroName}, I have no idea where this will lead us, but I have a definite feeling it will be a place both wonderful and strange."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P504128283" "{HeroName}, I'm going to let you in on a little secret. Every day, once a day, give yourself a present. Don't plan it. Don't wait for it. Just let it happen. It could be a new shirt at the men's store, a catnap in your office chair, or two cups of good, hot black coffee. That's my advice."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P1682433414" "When things are this quiet, you start to think too much. There are other parts of this city that could use your help. Maybe you should check into that."
// LocationString :
"P3310090529" "Croatoa"
// IntroString :
"P3914599353" "Detective Cooper is an eccentric genius working in Croatoa."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P1373105871" "Choose Detective Cooper"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P40725677" "Detective Cooper's ability is only matched by his eccentricity, but he's certain to help you out. Just don't let him talk about coffee too much."
// IntroduceOneContact :
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


