// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Detective Davids 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P2664191281" "Detective Davids"
// ProfessionString :
// DescriptionString :
"P1177235773" "Detective Davids and his partner Hutchinson are assigned to the mean streets of Independence Port. Together, they make the grooviest crime-fighting duo of the decade."
// LocationString :
"P224065995" "Independence Port"
// HelloString :
"P1047077530" "What's happening, {HeroName}?"
// HelloString :
"P3452480214" "What's the word, {HeroName}?"
// HelloString :
"P4221041265" "What's the word on the street, {HeroName}?"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2132449916" "Don't blow it for me, {HeroName}. I'm under cover. Besides, I think you're supposed to talk to my partner, Hutchinson."
// FirstVisitString :
"P1300721489" "{HeroName}, let me tell it like it is: All us cops are glad to have help from the city's heroes, and we want to make it easier for you. Take these frequencies for the local police radio bands, and keep your ears open. And hey, if you really work it out there, we'll be sure to call you when something big goes down."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1446795245" "There's not a lot happening right now, {HeroName}. It's real quiet out there."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P969575456" "Don't go raining on my parade, {HeroName}. You're already too busy to help me right now."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P1462276063" "You should come back when you've reached level 20. Until then, I can't safely give you any work."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P1556359461" "Your name's on the tip of every tongue out on the street. They know what's what."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P2407286790" "You keep it up at this rate, and there won't be any bad guys left. Good work."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P3102806010" "{HeroName}, you got more to do than sit here talking to me. Get to it."
// IntroString :
"P1320039957" "Detective Davids is one cool dude. He'll help you out."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P4131522465" "Choose Detective Davids"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P29477073" "Detective Davids is very with it. I think you'll really groove on his style."
// IntroduceOneContact :
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


