// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Detective Junkers 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1618376458" "Detective Junkers"
// ProfessionString :
// DescriptionString :
"P1659337465" "When he's not helping heroes, Detective Junkers has a unique speciality in the PPD. He's an expert at detecting fake humans and human imposters. His work has saved numerous lives and stopped schemes by Crey Industries, the Rikti, the Nemesis Army, and even the Circle of Thorns. He's extremely good at his job, but that also makes him distant and a bit paranoid. There were some jokes going around for a while that Junkers might be an escaped Paragon Protector or something himself, but no one takes that seriously."
// HelloString :
"P446302768" "Hey."
// HelloString :
"P206569089" "Are you ready?"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3806872639" "{HeroName}. Yeah, I know you. But you're not one of mine. Try talking to Detective Murwell."
// FirstVisitString :
"P3898797248" "{HeroName}, huh? I'd Detective Junkers. Okay, you need the frequencies for the police band radio, right? Well, whether you do or you don't I have them for you. You know the drill, you help us out, then we know we can trust you if something big goes down."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
// PlayerBusyString :
"P2582979828" "If you have too much going on, important details can get past you. Trust me, you have to pay attention to details. Come back when you've cleared a few missions, and aren't as distracted."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P709980853" "I've seen your file, {HeroName}. You're not ready for this yet. Come back when you're at least security level 30."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P1696992385" "Huh. Pretty good."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P1154031171" "You did well on that case."
// LocationString :
"P1346124042" "Founders Falls"
// IntroString :
"P3403360614" "Detective Junkers is an expert in an usual field, but he takes time out to help heroes"
// IntroAcceptString :
"P2948949806" "Choose Detective Junkers"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P406602778" "Junkers is a bit distant, but he has to be to do his job. He'll help you, though. He always comes through."
// IntroduceOneContact :
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


