// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Detective_Fish 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Detective Fish 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1824792134" "Detective Fish"
// ProfessionString :
// DescriptionString :
"P2536286195" "A lifetime working in Paragon City has taught Detective Fish a lot of valuable things that he continues to pass on to all those he works with."
// HelloString :
"P1078864330" "How are you doing? Me, I'm a bit chilly."
// HelloString :
"P2150545422" "What a day, huh?"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2759991645" "Another hero? Alright, you're {HeroName}, right? I'm looking here and it doesn't look like you're one of mine, at least, I'm not supposed to be working with you right now. Did you talk to Detective Miller? He might be able to help you."
// FirstVisitString :
"P3737390099" "You know how this works, right? I make sure you have the police band radio frequencies you need, and then if you help us out so we know we can count on you, you'll be the first one we'll talk to if something big goes down."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1336114517" "There just isn't much happening in our investigations right now. I don't mind that so much, but if you want to find something to do, maybe you should look at some of the other zones. Lots of places could use the help right now."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P3420005976" "Don't overdo it, {HeroName}. You've got a lot going on as it is. Why don't you finish up some of the things you're already doing for now?"
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P1105312657" "If I'm gonna send you out there, I think you need to be ready for it. Why don't you come back when you're around security level 30 or so."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P2057234399" "You've done some fine work, {HeroName}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P1257401389" "Thanks for all that you've done, {HeroName}."
// LocationString :
"P1230199062" "Brickstown"
// IntroString :
"P2729603804" "Detective Fish has been part of the force for years. He knows how things are done in Paragon City."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P2941164739" "Choose Detective Fish"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P927693709" "Detective Fish is one of the most experienced officers on the force. He'll be able to help you a great deal."
// IntroduceOneContact :
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


