// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Detective_Fraser 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Detective Frasenbacker 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P2196726173" "Detective Frasenbacker"
// ProfessionString :
// DescriptionString :
"P2696663851" "Detective Frasenbacker is actually a Canadian Mountie who has been working with the Paragon City police force ever since he first came to Paragon City on the trail of the killers of his father and, for reasons which don't need exploring at this juncture, remained, attached as liaison to the Canadian consulate."
// HelloString :
"P2517840714" "Thank you kindly, {HeroName}"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P1973952731" "I must apologize, {HeroName}, but it appears that you've been sent to me in error. I believe that you're really looking for Detective Kowaccio. I'm certain he'll be able to help you."
// FirstVisitString :
"P1662154365" "Ah, well you must be {HeroName}, a fine example of this fair city's citizen-protectors, no doubt. I am Detective Frasenbacker. To answer your next question, yes, I am a member of the Royal Canadian Mounted Police, or a 'Mountie', as you might say. I first came to Paragon City on the trail of the killers of my father and, for reasons which don't need exploring at this juncture, I have remained, attached as liaison to the Canadian consulate. Now that that's settled, let me give you the local police band frequencies. We may also need your help on special situations at a later date, if you have proven your mettle by assisting us with a number of these police band tasks."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P48827334" "While my current investigations have been wrapped up, I am aware that there are numerous ongoing difficulties throughout Paragon City, where someone of your ability could no doubt be quite useful."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P2254252732" "That's just silly, {HeroName}. You're obviously too overburdened at the moment. Please complete some of your other tasks, then return later, and I will be most gratified to work with you."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P54826555" "Much as I understand the deep desire within you to bring the forces of chaos to justice, I must also reprimand you for being over zealous. I would recommend that you return when you have achieved a security level of at least 15."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P1146344243" "Most well done, {HeroName}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P2439609070" "Your efforts are a credit to the meta-human community, and to this fair city."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P1260810082" "While my current investigations have been wrapped up, I am aware that there are numberous ongoing difficulties throughout Paragon City, where someone of your ability could no doubt be quite useful."
// LocationString :
"P3230763425" "Faultline"
// IntroString :
"P339171281" "Detective Frasenbacker is actually a member of the Royal Canadian Mounted Police who first came to Paragon City on the trail of the killers of his father and, for reasons which don't need exploring at this juncture, remained, attached as liaison to the Canadian consulate. However, he often works with the PPD on a number of cases. Currently he's working in the newly restored Faultline."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P1053548025" "Choose Detective Frasenbacker"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P3399540165" "Detective Frasenbacker is a fine example of the lawmen of our neighbor to the north. I'm sure he'll be able to help you."
// IntroduceOneContact :
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


