// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Detective_Hooker 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 28 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Detective Hooker 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P381150855" "Detective Hooker"
// ProfessionString :
// DescriptionString :
"P632875373" "Detective Hooker is well known not only for his dedication to the job, but also for his entertainment career before becoming a cop. He's played a space-ship captain, a powerful lawyer, had a singing career, and even did a horror movie in esperanto. But now Hooker's taking on his biggest role of all: Making Paragon City a safer place."
// HelloString :
"P3715143366" "{HeroName}! Its... Good to see you."
// HelloString :
"P2166285035" "Evil... Doesn't rest."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P411122131" "{HeroName}, ... I've heard so much about you that... I wanted to work with you. But that is not to be! You've been assigned to work with Detective Serpico."
// FirstVisitString :
"P1877899252" "{HeroName}! I've just had an idea! You! You need the right frequencies. Police band frequencies so that you... You can talk to us at any time. Listen! Can you listen to the police band radio? Can you hear it, {HeroName}? If you help us, if you use this radio to help us, then I'll know to ask you for help on big cases."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P954282590" "The City... It sleeps. My investigations, are quiet. But there are other places where you, where heroes like you, are needed. Go to them. Where they need you, {HeroName}."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P3789836386" "{HeroName}! You've got to focus! You've got too many things going on right now. Finish some other missions, then... Then I'll be able to work with you again."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P104335382" "{HeroName}! I need more power! The bad guys, you're not ready for them yet. You've got to have more power. Security level 20, at least. You've got to give me more power!"
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P3934639122" "{HeroName}! I've heared all that you've been doing. It's fantastic."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P1129329655" "{HeroName}! You're name is the one on everyone's lips. The bad guys are afraid of you, and that's good."
