// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Detective Hutchinson 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P3869901588" "Detective Hutchinson"
// ProfessionString :
// DescriptionString :
"P1934747801" "Detective Hutchinson and his partner Davids are assigned to the mean streets of Independence Port. Together, they make the grooviest crime-fighting duo of the decade."
// LocationString :
// HelloString :
"P454820531" "Tell it like it is, {HeroName}."
// HelloString :
// HelloString :
"P1601946337" "We gotta clean up this city, {HeroName}."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P4267330901" "Cool it out, {HeroName}. I'm undercover. I can't help you right now. Talk to my partner, Detective Davids."
// FirstVisitString :
"P1829688396" "What it is, {HeroName}. I'm Hutchinson. Undercover Detective. I work the streets of Independence Port, but we can always use the help of heroes like you. Let me make sure you're clued in to the local police band radio frequencies. If you help us out, we'll come to you if anything crazy happens. Dig?"
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P2770484929" "Maybe you've done too much good, {HeroName}. There's not much going on right now."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1591534409" "Don't talk the talk if you can't walk the walk, {HeroName}. You're already too busy to be coming to me."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P491855505" "Swing back on by when you're at least level 20. Then it'll be time to get groovy."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P3327404512" "Word on the street is that you're the hepest cat in Independence Port. Good to hear you're making your name."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P475493067" "All the crooks are getting scared. You're really doing the job, my man."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P4136026737" "You've really cleaned up around here, but maybe you should look to another zone that could use your help."
// IntroString :
"P3274202498" "Detective Hutchinson is one hep cat. He'll help you out."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P819277871" "Choose Detective Hutchinson"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P3735735301" "I think you'll really dig working with Detective Hutchinson."
// IntroduceOneContact :
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
