// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Detective_Magnum 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Detective Selnum 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P3869408991" "Detective Selnum"
// ProfessionString :
// DescriptionString :
"P2237108061" "Detective Selnum left a career with the Navy after the war and came to Peregrine Island. Though he originally started off as a private investigator, he later joined the PPD."
// HelloString :
"P2576264892" "Welcome to the island."
// HelloString :
"P318048356" "Island life is pretty good, {HeroName}."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3962297312" "Just wait a second, {HeroName}, we'll get this figured out, just let me look at the paperwork. Okay, according to this, you're not working with me right now. Huh. Maybe you should talk to McLord."
// FirstVisitString :
"P4131706286" "Okay. You're {HeroName}, I get that. Now let me make sure you have what you need. You got the Police Band radio frequencies? Okay, now if you help us out some, we'll know we can count on you, and we'll be sure to call you if anything big is going to happen."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P2424745154" "There's not a lot going on right now. Nothing to do but sit on the beach sipping mai-tais. And that sounds like a pretty good plan to me."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P2626651349" "{HeroName}, you've just got to learn to pace yourself. You've already got too much going on. Come back when you've finished some of the things you're doing."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P735068140" "You've still got a ways to go. Peregrine Island is a great place, but you should really be around security level 40 before you spend too much time here."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P474370470" "I heard about what you did. That sounds like a great story. You'll have to tell it to me."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P3215874020" "Hey, {HeroName}, I got this old buddy of mine who owns this club right on the beach. Give me your number, I'll get you in."
// LocationString :
"P891522995" "Peregrine Island"
// IntroString :
"P3527103829" "Detective Selnum used to be a private investigator, but now works with the PPD in Peregrine Island."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P2978522869" "Choose Detective Selnum"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P3711497778" "Detective Selnum likes to live well and hang out with his old military pals, but don't think that he's any less dedicated to law and order for it."
// IntroduceOneContact :
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
