// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Detective_Martins 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Detective Martins 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P2140246138" "Detective Martins"
// ProfessionString :
"P677409785" "PPD Liason"
// DescriptionString :
"P2783335973" "Detective Martins is still recovering from some personal trauma, and some on the force think he's a loose weapon. But he's still been a great help to many of the city's heroes, and an outstanding cop."
// HelloString :
"P2601791736" "You ready to take on the world?"
// HelloString :
"P2478605847" "How ya doing, {HeroName}?"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P1920049498" "Okay, so there's some Malta guys I need you to take... Oh, no, wait. You're {HeroName}, right? You're supposed to be working with Detective Rogers. Aw, don't worry about it. Probably a pencil-pusher at HQ got that messed up."
// FirstVisitString :
"P2040996222" "Well, let's get this started. I'm Detective Martins, and I'm a cop. No, really. And I'm here to help you. First, let me make sure you have the police radio codes, and then, you do some stuff around here and we'll be able to send priority alerts to you. That'll be fun, trust me."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3885459594" "Huh. You think there's not much going on? Well, you're right, there isn't."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1682162192" "Now, I'm all for taking on too much, but I'm a cop and stuff, and they like you to follow rules and things, so I can't give you anything until you're finished with all the other things you're doing."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P1873029299" "Don't take this the wrong way, but sending you out right now would be suicide. And that's something I don't want. So, toughen yourself up, and come back when you're at least security level 5. We can talk then."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P2642600663" "Wow, that was something. If there's one thing the city needs more of it's something like that."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P2659357114" "You're doing so much, the bad guys have gotta be going nuts."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P418326340" "I think you may have overdone it. All the bad guys are laying low, for now at least."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P1741005600" "Detective Martins may be a bit odd, but he's a good cop. He'll help you out."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P4292866549" "Choose Detective Martins"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P3319497302" "Detective Martins will be able to help you."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P2548054189" "I've got <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>someone</a> I'd like you to meet."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P2589570214" "There are a couple <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>people</a> I know want to meet you."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


