// Name :
"P179535709" "Detective McDallas"
// ProfessionString :
// DescriptionString :
"P2664341704" "A former special forces operative, cab driver, and oil rig worker, Detective McDallas has brought his wide range of experience to the Paragon City police department. He works out of Steel Canyon, where he also lives with his wife, Loolee."
// HelloString :
"P2034675290" "Welcome to the party, {HeroName}."
// HelloString :
"P1002049008" "Yipee-kai-yai-yay, {HeroName}."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P1117964304" "Yo, you're {HeroName}, right? That's cool, but I think you're supposed to be talking to Detective Bauer. <br><br>Just go easy on him. <br>He's had a lot of bad days."
// FirstVisitString :
"P3798447489" "You're {HeroName}, right? Yeah, I heard about you. Heard you were pretty good. Let me make sure you have all you need to get on the local police bands. And hey! It's good to have the help."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1479991502" "Hey there, look who dropped by. How ya doin' {HeroName}? Well, there's not much going on around here right now that'd interest you. Maybe you should try another zone. Something closer to your security level, you know?"
// PlayerBusyString :
"P3766635853" "Whoah, whoah, whoah there cochise. Slow down a bit. You're no use to anybody if you've got too much going on. Finish a couple missions, I may have something for you then."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P3792614867" "Yeah, swing back when you're around security level 10 or so. That'll be about right."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P3086675605" "I saw that thing you did. Nice."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P2272450650" "Hey hey, {HeroName}. Good one."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P1587796024" "Yeah, I think that does it for now. How about you stop wasting time around here, and you go out there and be a hero."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P2085870490" "Detective McDallas has done a lot of things, but these days he's a hero liason in Steel Canyon."
// IntroAcceptString :
// IntroSendoffString :
"P2535122993" "Detective McDallas can handle just about anything. And the things he can't handle, he'll send your way."
// IntroduceOneContact :
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
