// Name :
"P3344106494" "Detective McLord"
// ProfessionString :
// DescriptionString :
"P3859340006" "A former navy officer, Detective McLord has joined the Paragon City Police Department to protect the people of Peregrine Island from all the bad guys, maniacs, and scum that would do them harm."
// HelloString :
"P1290380419" "Book 'em, {HeroName}"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2679492889" "I got a lot of work to do, {HeroName}, and you're not part of it, at least not that I know of yet. Maybe you need to talk to Detective Selnum."
// FirstVisitString :
"P4116164881" "{HeroName}, the first thing to do is figure out the basic M.O. You're a hero, that's pretty clear. And just in case you don't know how this works, I'll tell you: I give you the frequencies for the Police Band radio, then you help us with some cases if you want. You do that, and when something big comes up, you'll be the first one we'll talk to."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1729295359" "We got it under wraps, {HeroName}. And you've got bigger fish to fry."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P2612354788" "You got too much to do already, {HeroName}. Big things, important things. You let us handle this end of things until you finish some of that up."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P58919745" "I appreciate the thought, {HeroName}, but right now you'd get murdered out there. Come back when you're around security level 40."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P122287882" "{HeroName}, I hear you've been turning this Island upside-down fighting crime. That's what I like to hear!"
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P66821213" "The bad guys just don't understand that they'll never win with heroes like you around."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P1435382446" "Detective McLord is a tough no-nonsense cop who works out of Peregrine Island."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P4257236950" "Choose Detective McLord"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P4010433511" "Detective McLord doesn't pull any punches, and never gives up. He's a cop's cop, all the way through."
