// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Detective Miller 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P3737140223" "Detective Miller"
// ProfessionString :
// DescriptionString :
"P2614968624" "A long-term veteran of the force, Detective Miller has seen it all, and watched it happen with a wry smile and the sense of perspective that only a lifetime in Paragon City can give you."
// HelloString :
"P1538931009" "It's crazy out there."
// HelloString :
"P2566180929" "Don't lose your perspective."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P324647987" "Let me look at this. Okay {HeroName}, it looks like you're not on my list yet. But hey, maybe you should check with Detective Fish, too?"
// FirstVisitString :
"P2558948738" "Alright {HeroName}, I don't know if you know how this works, but I'm Detective Miller, and it's part of my job to make sure you can help the police and we can help you and all that. So, let me make sure you have the police radio frequencies. Okay, here's how it works: You help us, and we'll know we can count on you. Then, if something big happens, we'll let you know first thing."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1136848558" "Look, I have a big spiel about not losing your perspective and all, but I really don't think I need to give it to you. You know that there's bigger things for you to do, so why not just go and do some of 'em, alright?"
// PlayerBusyString :
"P3961467474" "You seem to have a lot going on right now, {HeroName}. Maybe you should pull back a bit, and finish up some of this stuff before you start looking for new things to do."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P1258289376" "I'm not sure you're ready for this yet. Why don't you come back around when you're about security level 30 or so?"
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P3099670548" "We do everything here by the book, according to regulations, and above board. That's why it's sometimes good to have some people around who are a bit outside the system, like you."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P288321697" "We're pretty lucky you've been willing to help, {HeroName}."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P3788913453" "Look, I have a big spiel about not loosing your perspective and all, but I really don't think I need to give it to you. You know that there's bigger things for you to do, so why not just go and do some of 'em, alright?"
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P3859901413" "Detective Miller has been on the force for a long time, and he knows how things work in this city. He'll be sure to help you."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P2329863288" "Choose Detective Miller"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P2502890292" "Detective Miller's work with heroes is one of the reasons for the whole police liason program."
// IntroduceOneContact :
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


