// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Detective Murwell 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1128786186" "Detective Murwell"
// ProfessionString :
// DescriptionString :
"P591207326" "Following his near-death during a Malta attack, Detective Murwell had to undergo major cybernetic reconstruction. This has placed a great deal of stress on him and his family, and has given him a darker and almost mechanical attitude. However, many on the force hope that Murwell will return to his old self, and hope working with heroes will help him do it."
// HelloString :
"P1731032266" "Thank you for your cooperation"
// HelloString :
"P2143650768" "Looking for me?"
// HelloString :
"P2050812512" "Somewhere, there is a crime happening."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3851946360" "You are not in my files, citizen. I would recommend that you speak to Detective Junkers. He may be able to assist you."
// FirstVisitString :
"P2005399342" "I am Detective Murwell. It is my duty to assist you. I will first ensure that you have the proper frequencies for the police radio band. Be attentive to the police radio, and you may recieve warnings of crimes as they occur. This will help you serve the public trust, protect the innocent, and uphold the law. If you assist the police with several incidents, we will contact you for further assistance should something unique arise. "
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1578126728" "There are no further alerts on the police radio bands that match your abilities. It is advised that you might seek to aid the city elsewhere."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P2626132609" "Splitting your attention too far is detrimental to your ability to focus. Complete other missions before you return."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P2046671813" "According to police files, you have not yet acheived a sufficient security level for this area. Please return when you have acheived a minimum security level of 30."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P1930199319" "Thank you for your assistance."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P1283719519" "You have done a great deal for the citizens of this city."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P1856960914" "Detective Murwell is a cyborg cop working working in Founders Falls."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P2951108272" "Choose Detective Murwell"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P67353714" "Don't let Detective Murwell's cold manner put you off. There's one of the best cops in the force in there."
// IntroduceOneContact :
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


