"P327504100" "Detective Basinns"
// ProfessionString :
// DescriptionString :
"P2092931180" "There are some in the department who criticise both Detective Basinns and his partner Detective Croquette for placing their personal style over their jobs, but those critics don't understand that their style is important to the kind of undercover work they must do."
// HelloString :
"P2179447703" "Be cool, {HeroName}."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P956387206" "I think you're supposed to be working with Detective Croquette, {HeroName}. Now, don't cramp my style."
// FirstVisitString :
"P4272761136" "You need Police Band frequencies? I got that for you. You help out on some of those, we'll let you know when something big is going down."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3155168430" "The streets have gotten quiet. Me, I'm a guy who likes action. You want to find something going on, it might be time for you to move on."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P2454764997" "I need your total focus, {HeroName}. If you want to help me, then handle some of your other missions first."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P86637771" "You need to get a bit more experience before you're ready to help me. Come back when you're above security level 20."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P1317216035" "You handled that pretty well."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P4148908923" "You've really got it down, {HeroName}"
// LocationString :
"P3637129972" "Talos Island"
// IntroString :
"P1662830068" "Detective Basinns is in Talos Island, where he fights crime with style."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P3892599670" "Choose Detective Basinns"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P366235489" "Detective Basinns may look like a player, but he's a cop through and through."
