// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Detective Rogers 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P156530335" "Detective Rogers"
// ProfessionString :
// DescriptionString :
"P4019938136" "Detective Rogers is a 30 year veteran on the force, whose experience has helped numerous heroes."
// HelloString :
"P2651558154" "Hey, Hero. You here to help?"
// HelloString :
"P239568378" "We got a situation, {HeroName}."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2088550039" "You're {HeroName}, right? Now wait, I heard about this from HQ. Hold on, you're supposed to be working with Martins, right? Sorry for that mix-up."
// FirstVisitString :
"P2718757763" "I've been a cop for a long time, {HeroName}, and experience has taught me to appreciate when someone offers to help. Once you've done some things and we've gotten to know you, we'll be sure to contact you if a real emergency comes up."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P186142225" "We've got things under control right now, but keep your ear open and listen to the police band."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1699778806" "You gotta slow down there, {HeroName}. You got enough to do right now. Finish some other things first, alright?"
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P3540056306" "Look, I know you want to help, but I need to know you can take care of yourself first. Come back when you're certified for security level 5 at least, okay?"
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P2963475942" "That's some kind of work you do. The kind of thing this city needs."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P2016862466" "With heroes like you around, I'll be able to retire soon."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P1533467846" "Things are quiet right now. Maybe you should check out some of the other zones, though. I'm sure they could use your help."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P3158771952" "Detective Rogers is a veteran of 30 years. He won't steer you wrong."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P3350925677" "Choose Detective Rogers"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P979311697" "Detective Rogers will do you right."
