// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Detective Serpico 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P4247552170" "Detective Serpico"
// ProfessionString :
// DescriptionString :
"P1348974920" "Detective Serpico recently transferred to Paragon City after exposing police corruption tied to the Nemesis Army in his old district. His presence sends a strong signal that the new PPD will be an uncorruptable and honest police force."
// HelloString :
"P3193209978" "I'm just an honest cop doing the job."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P528909831" "You know, I think you ain't working with me. I think you're supposed to be working with Detective Hooker. He's kinda excitable, but he's an honest cop."
// FirstVisitString :
"P2463798551" "All this trouble on the streets, I was expecting they'd send a division. But I've heard you're worth that and more, {HeroName}. First, I got some police radio frequencies, let me make sure you have them. Check your radio whenever you want, there's trouble enough to go around. And if you do good, I'll pass the big stuff on to you."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3025430543" "Hey, there just ain't nothing going on. Sometimes that's how it is. And that ain't so bad. But you, maybe you should think about other places where people need you more. I'll keep an eye on things here."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P3223841231" "Look, this ain't just a job to me, and it ain't just a hobby to you. So do right by us both and finish your other work first. I can't have you distracted on this."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P2725143225" "There's a lot of good word about you, but I gotta know you can handle it out there. Get yourself to, what, security level 20 or so."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P4262413486" "People are talking about the good you do, {HeroName}. That's real good."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P2656929704" "You gotta lot of people out here feeling safer, {HeroName}."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P1396848159" "Detective Serpico is an honest cop doing his job in Independance Port."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P2039389745" "Choose Detective Serpico"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P2804824294" "Detective Serpico is an honest cop who just wants to do what's right."
// IntroduceOneContact :
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
