// Name :
"P165751955" "Detective Croquette"
// ProfessionString :
// DescriptionString :
"P3520599891" "There are some in the department who criticise both Detective Croquette and his partner Detective Basinns for placing their personal style over their jobs, but those critics don't understand that their style is important to the kind of undercover work they must do."
// HelloString :
"P3602766822" "Chill out, {HeroName}."
// HelloString :
"P2339678243" "You ready for some trouble, {HeroName}?"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2344382436" "You're supposed to be working with Detective Basins, {HeroName}. Now move on before you blow my cover."
// FirstVisitString :
"P1876731630" "I've heard a lot about you through my connections, {HeroName}. A lot of bad guys are scared of you, which is fine by me. Let's make sure you have all the proper frequencies so you can check out the police band around here first. Check it whenever you like. After you've built up a reputation, if anything big goes down, I'll tell you about it first."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3871126832" "Things have cooled down on these streets. And much as I like that, I know that there are other places that need you more than I do here."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P2308490091" "Be cool, {HeroName}. Finish up some of your other work, then come back."
// ComeBackLaterString :
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P997006429" "That case is wrapped up, thanks to you."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P3513776666" "They never even knew what hit them. Good work, {HeroName}."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P1200035657" "Detective Croquette works out on Talos Island, where he fights crime and looks good doing it."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P3881973828" "Choose Detective Croquette"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P3995653671" "Don't let Detective Croquette's flashy attire put you off, there's a real cop in there."
// IntroduceOneContact :
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


