// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Detective Becktrees 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1196315387" "Detective Becktrees"
// ProfessionString :
// DescriptionString :
"P3843485851" "Detective Becktrees is one of the most friendly cops on the force, and many heroes have started their careers with his help."
// HelloString :
"P3387187374" "{HeroName}! Good to see you!"
// HelloString :
"P2612491179" "Lookin' good, {HeroName}."
// HelloString :
"P3209420358" "Thank goodness, it's {HeroName}!"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2677997628" "Aw, jeez, {HeroName}. I'd love to help you, but I think you're supposed to talk to my partner, Freitag. He'll steer you right."
// FirstVisitString :
"P4250685268" "Hi there {HeroName}. I'm Detective Becktrees, PPD. Detective Freitag's my partner, and we're here to help you get started with things. Okay, the way this works is, you keep an ear out on the police radio, and anytime you can help us, we'll appreciate it. After you've done enough to prove yourself, if anything big comes up, we'll try to get in touch with you directly."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P4040646090" "There's nothing going on right now. Things are so quiet, you can hear Freitag unwind."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P3980179321" "Look, I've seen all the things you're doing, and I think you already have a lot to do. Things are calm right now. Take the opportunity to get things finished. We can handle if for now."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P4063295087" "I am so glad you want to help, but maybe you should wait a bit. Until you're about Security level 5 or so, at least."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P698001732" "{HeroName}, I think this may be the beginning of a beautiful friendship."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P1158213587" "You've been a real big help out there, {HeroName}."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P3594477505" "You have a lot of more important things to do than hang out around here. Go on, save the world or something. We'll stay here and try to keep Kings Row from being eaten by monsters."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P852345681" "You should talk to Detective Becktrees. He's a little weird, but a fine policeman."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P2756017744" "Choose Detective Becktrees"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P612828647" "Detective Becktrees loves to work with heroes. I think you'll get along with him just fine."
// IntroduceOneContact :
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P3714099071" "Some <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>people</a> I know want to meet you."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


