// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Detective Truman 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P2979472726" "Detective Truman"
// ProfessionString :
// DescriptionString :
"P3064079041" "Detective Truman is a native of Croatoa who has policed his home town for years. He knows a lot about the people of the town, including many strange secrets."
// HelloString :
"P1584251874" "You keeping out of too much trouble, {HeroName}?"
// HelloString :
"P2703635229" "Don't let yourself get too lost around here, {HeroName}."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P1765312614" "Yeah, I've heard of you, {HeroName}. But I haven't heard that I'm supposed to be working with you. Maybe you should try Detective Cooper."
// FirstVisitString :
"P3838843863" "I'm not a fancy words kinda guy, but I would like to thank you for asking to help out. Let me make sure you have all the proper frequencies, then you'll be good to go. Oh, and if you help out some, we'll let you know if there's anything big going down."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1563837028" "I'm looking into a lot of things, but right now, I think you've done all you need to around here. There are other places that need you more, and much as a help you've been, I'm not a greedy man."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P3115701936" "There's always a lot going on if you know how to look. But sometimes, there's too much going on, if you understand. I think that's how it is for you right now. You should wrap some of that up, then come back when you're ready."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P3744792758" "You shouldn't go charging off into the unknown unless you're able to handle yourself. I'll tell you what, you come back when your security level is around 25 or so, and I'll be able to help you then."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P4255693008" "That was some excellent work, {HeroName}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P1562151651" "You know, I think I'd better start studying medicine because I'm beginning to feel a bit like Dr. Watson."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P775542782" "Detective Truman is a native of Croatoa, and has a good insight to where the police up there could use a hero's help."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P633055274" "Choose Detective Truman"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P217666839" "Detective Truman is a solid cop, even if his home town is the center of weirdness for the region."
// IntroduceOneContact :
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


