// Name :
"P108390529" "Detective Kowaccio"
// ProfessionString :
// DescriptionString :
"P3163007437" "DetectiveKowaccio is loud, brash, and willing to bend the rules to break a case. He's also one of the best cops on the force."
// HelloString :
"P2239770553" "Yo, {HeroName}."
// HelloString :
"P3136047975" "You ready, {HeroName}?"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2878956699" "Yeah, it looks like there's been some kind of mix-up. You're probably supposed to work with Detective Frasenbacker."
// FirstVisitString :
"P3717174131" "So, I'm Detective Kowaccio, and I'm supposed to make sure you have the police band frequencies. Just check your radio whenever and listen. There's stuff going on all the time out there. And hey, if you do enough stuff, we'll let you know when something big's gonna go down."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P294621494" "Yeah, there ain't nothing happening on any of the investigations."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P582855116" "Don't ya think you're overdoin' it some? Get outta here, finish your work, and get back to me when you've got less to do."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P3196298577" "You ain't got what it takes yet, {HeroName}. But thanks for asking. You want to help? Come back when you're around level 15, or talk to another detective in another zone."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P3245709367" "That was a pretty good job, {HeroName}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P975847659" "Now you got it, {HeroName}"
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P3571437627" "Detective Kowaccio may be a bit crude on the outside, but he's a good cop. He's currently working in Faultline."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P1095071662" "Choose Detective Kowaccio"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P142309793" "Detective Kowaccio may not make friends easily, but he's an excellent cop."
