"P152194152" "Officer Friday is a straight-talking no-nonsense kind of cop who sticks to just the facts. He lives with his wife Connie here in Atlas Park."
// HelloString :
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P1659900988" "Sorry, {HeroName}, I'm a little busy with my current investigation. Perhaps you should speak with Officer Streebeck. I'm sure he'll be happy to help you."
// FirstVisitString :
"P2969246790" "Good to meet you, {HeroName}. I'm Officer Friday. My partner is Officer Streebeck. We're cops. We're here to help, but we can't handle everything, and sometimes we have to call on the post-human residents of this fair city for additional aid. You do right, we might even have some special work to contact you about."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
