"P3631886246" "Police Radio"
// ProfessionString :
"P3402256811" "Police Radio"
// DescriptionString :
"P715581830" "Using the police radio frequencies, you'll be able to help the PPD fight crime."
// HelloString :
"P2380099776" "Several police band bulletins catch your attention:"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P1202380580" "You need to get the Police frequencies from one of the liason officers."
// FirstVisitString :
"P2055404918" "You tune in the frequencies for this part of the city, and listen to the pulsing beat of the metropolis."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P4007629596" "While listening for the latest signs of trouble, you hear a call asking for heroes to speak with {BrokerName} directly. Something big is happening."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P2029953258" "Things seem quiet right now. That's probably a good thing, considering how much you already have to do."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P3259840912" "The things you're hearing on radio sound far too difficult right now. As much as you may want to help, you'll need to be a higher security level before you'll be able to assist."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P595920475" "relationshipchangestring."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P2736134398" "relationshipchangetoconfidant"
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P257857242" "The events here seem to be beneath your notice."
// LocationString :
"P324264939" "Paragon City"
// IntroString :
"P3038630335" "Take this police band radio, and these frequency settings. The Paragon Police are always glad to get help from the city's heroes."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P1602061632" "Accept the Police Radio"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P666548942" "<color deepskyblue>Now that you've gotten a Police Radio, you can start scanning Police chatter to hear about the crimes as they're committed in your current zone. You can then act on a report by selecting it from the Police Radio, listed under your Contacts.</color>"
// IntroduceOneContact :
